&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;def A&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    ...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; something&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;def B&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    ...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; something&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;def B&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    ...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; something&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;def 호출자&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    A&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    B&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    C&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;함수 A, B, C가 있다고 가정&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;호출자가 다른 함수 A를 호출했을 때&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;호출자와 A 모두 실행 상태&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;호출자가 제어할 수 없는 대상인 A가 별도의 제어권을 얻어 실행되어
호출자의 행동이 블로킹 되지 않아 함수 A가 실행중인 상태로 끝나지도 않았는데
B를 호출, 마찬가지로 C도 호출할 수 있음&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;동기synchronous비동기asynchronous&#34;&gt;동기(synchronous)/비동기(asynchronous)
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;작업(들)이 같이 시작해, 같이 끝나는가?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;제어권의 반환과 결과값의 전달이 같이 이루어지는가&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;동기&#34;&gt;동기
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/12.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2080&#34;
	height=&#34;596&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/12_hu15451014369684377421.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/12_hu6031903467145047116.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34; &#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;348&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;837px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;작업들이 같이 시작해 같이 끝남&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/13.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2104&#34;
	height=&#34;602&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/13_hu1109871924350163215.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/13_hu7759981835352783680.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34; &#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;349&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;838px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;도중에 B가 끼어든다면? 같이 시작한 것이 아님&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;작업 중에 다른 작업이 끼어들지 못하게 하기 위해 사용&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;비동기&#34;&gt;비동기
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/14.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2002&#34;
	height=&#34;640&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/14_hu7009562975075916052.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/14_hu16246588141655476720.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34; &#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;312&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;750px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;작업들의 시작과 끝이 다름&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;작업 중에 끼어들어도 괜찮음&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;시작, 종료 시기를 신경쓰지 않기 위해 사용&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;동기블로킹-비동기논블로킹&#34;&gt;동기==블로킹?, 비동기==논블로킹?
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Block                              Synchronous&lt;br&gt;
                           ==&lt;br&gt;
Non-Block               Asynchronous&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;블로킹은 제어권을 호출된 함수가 들고 있다가 결과값을 반환할 때 돌려주는 것이고,
동기는 제어권을 반환하는 시간과 결과값을 반환하는 시간이 일치하는 것인데
그러면 블로킹과 동기가 같은게 아닌가?
마찬가지로 논블로킹과 비동기가 같은게 아닌가?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;관점이 다르다.&lt;br&gt;
블로킹/논블로킹: &lt;strong&gt;제어권&lt;/strong&gt;에 대한 관점&lt;br&gt;
동기/비동기: &lt;strong&gt;시간&lt;/strong&gt;에 대한 관점. 즉, 제어권을 반환하는 시점, 타이밍의 관점&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;linuxio-models&#34;&gt;LinuxI/O models
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;-Application이 호출자, Kernel을 함수 A,B,C로 보면 됨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;동기/블로킹 I/O Model&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/15.png&#34;
	width=&#34;538&#34;
	height=&#34;340&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/15_hu1446393679191986849.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/15_hu8593389056055146163.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
