		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;158&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;379px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;동기/논블로킹 I/O Model&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/16.png&#34;
	width=&#34;474&#34;
	height=&#34;340&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/16_hu15729358397920729899.png 480w, https://expiator8.github.io/p/%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%99%80-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0/16_hu5511314457030688322.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34; &#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;139&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;334px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;결과값은 함수가 완료된 상태뿐 아니라 완료되지 않은 상태도 결과값이다
제어권과 함께 함수가 아직 &lt;strong&gt;완료되지 않았다는 결과값&lt;/strong&gt;을 전달했기 때문에 동기다&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt; 1
