&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;import asyncio
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;from datetime import datetime
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;from random import randint
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;async def run_job&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; -&amp;gt; None:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;delay&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; randint&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;5, 15&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    print&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;f&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;{datetime.now()} sleep for {delay} seconds&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    await asyncio.sleep&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;delay&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 5~15초 동안 잠자기&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    print&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;f&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;{datetime.now()} finished ({delay} sec)&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;async def main&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; -&amp;gt; None:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; True:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        asyncio.create_task&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;run_job&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        await asyncio.sleep&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;10&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;asyncio.run&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;main&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 2024-11-15 09:00:32.209662 sleep for 5 seconds&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 2024-11-15 09:00:37.210256 finished (5 sec)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 2024-11-15 09:00:42.210417 sleep for 13 seconds&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 2024-11-15 09:00:52.211457 sleep for 15 seconds&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 2024-11-15 09:00:55.211784 finished (13 sec)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 2024-11-15 09:01:02.213019 sleep for 9 seconds&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 2024-11-15 09:01:07.212445 finished (15 sec)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# 2024-11-15 09:01:11.214358 finished (9 sec)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# ...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;await의 역할&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;뒤에 나오는 코루틴(Awaitable 객체)를 Eventloop에 등록&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;코루틴이 끝날 때 결과값을 전달받기를 기다리며 제어권을 Eventloop로 반환&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;await나 return을 하지 않는 이상 Eventloop로 제어권을 반환하고 다른 코루틴을 실행할 방법이 없기 때문에&lt;br&gt;
requests등의 블로킹 코드를 코루틴 내부에서 실행하는데 주의가 필요하다는 것.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;async/await를 했을때&lt;br&gt;
await를 하면 이벤트 루프가 돌지 않는가? 이벤트 루프가 돈다. 그러면 비동기라고 할 수 있지 않나?&lt;br&gt;
함수 내부에서만 보면 동기/블로킹으로 작동하고 있을 것이다.&lt;br&gt;
왜냐? await가 끝나기 전까지는 그 밑의 작업을 실행할 수 없다.&lt;br&gt;
하지만 코드 전체를 보면 비동기적으로 작동하는 로직들이 많을 것이다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 코드는 동기다! 비동기에 논블로킹이다! 라고 하기가 힘들다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;∴블로킹/논블로킹, 동기/비동기는 일정한 영역에 한정적으로 봤을때는 추정할 수 있지만
코드 전체적으로 봤을때는 한가지로 단정지을수 없다.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block/Non-block: 제어권. 제어할 수 없는 대상을 어떻게 처리하는가. 제어권을 누가 가지고 언제 반환하는가.&lt;br&gt;
Synchronous/Asynchronous: 시간. 제어권을 반환하는 시간, 결과값을 전달하는 시간이 일치하는가&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
